          "items": [
            "Commodore's Retreat unit 301 is a 1 bedroom condo with hall bunks that sleeps 6. King Master bedroom with bathroom accessible from bedroom or hallway, Bunks in the hallway. Full kitchen. Unit also has a washer and dryer. Complimentary wifi is also included with the condo. <br><br>Beach service included March-October, this includes 2 chairs and 1 umbrella set up for you everyday. This amenity is complimentary, and no compensation will be offered if beach service is unavailable due to acts of God.<br><br>The complex has charcoal grills and a community pool on-site. <br><br>This unit rents weekly from Saturday-Saturday throughout Spring, Summer, and Fall. This condo does not accept Winter monthly rentals, nightly rentals only.",
