        "label": "Terrible",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": "Our stay was impacted by several unresolved issues. Basic items like washcloths were not provided upon arrival, and the internet did not work properly throughout the stay, with some devices never connecting.The most significant issue was the air conditioning. We reported it not working, and after the second night of the air not working a portable unit was provided only for the bedroom, but it did not cool the bedroom and the unit remained uncomfortably warm, especially at night.We requested some sort of compensation for the inconvenience, but none was provided. We paid for a stay with working amenities as advertised, and that was not delivered.",
